:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the stage, see [[Takeda]]''.
'''Takeda Shingen''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 2.3 Update|Version 2.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] increases his health, attack power and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

